# Vue & PWA

- SFCs: `<script setup lang="ts">`. Composition API only.
- Follow existing Prettier/ESLint (no semicolons, single quotes).
- Router guards for auth and household onboarding.
- PWA via `vite-plugin-pwa`: installable shell plus IndexedDB replica and mutation outbox. Server is source of truth after sync; do not add a third-party sync service.
- Do not invent global CSS frameworks unless the task asks. Keep styles local/scoped unless shared tokens exist.
